<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="publishid" content="" />
    <!--<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=0, minimum-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black">
<meta content="telephone=no" name="format-detection">-->
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge, chrome=1" />
    <title>中国互联网联合辟谣平台</title>
    <meta name="description" content=" " />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://www.piyao.org.cn/global/public/css/common.css" />
    <!-- <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://www.piyao.org.cn/index/css/top.css" /> -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://www.piyao.org.cn/common/lib2021/ej/ej.css">
    <style>
        #main {
            width: 792px;
            height: 323px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: url(https://www.piyao.org.cn/none/image/404.png) no-repeat;
            margin-top: 10.7%;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 5%;
        }

        .zjd {
            width: 263px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            overflow: hidden;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #1e1e76;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 21px;
            margin-top: 200px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        #xy {
            color: #b62d03;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .footer {
    background: #2f3b49;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 32px;
    padding: 30px 0;
    color: #77879b;
    margin-top: 50px;
}
.footer a {
    color: #77879b;
}
.footer img {
    vertical-align: top;
    margin-top: 6px;
}
    </style>
    <script src="https://www.piyao.org.cn/global/lib/jq/jquery1.12.4/jquery1.12.4.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://www.piyao.org.cn/piyaogov/js/scrolltopcontrol.js"></script>
    <script src="https://www.piyao.org.cn/global/lib/xpage/xpage.min.js"></script>
</head>

<body data-type="txt">
    <div>
        <script src="https://www.piyao.org.cn/common/lib2021/ej/tophead.js"></script>
    </div>
    <div class="content">

        <div id="main">
            <div class="zjd">
                <p>对不起，您要访问的页面不存在或已被删除!<br>
                    本页面<span id="xy">5</span>秒后将带您回到中国互联网联合</br>辟谣平台网首页</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    </div>
    <div class="clearfix"></div>
    <!-- footer -->
    <script src="https://www.piyao.org.cn/js/footer.js"></script>
    <!-- END -->
    <script type="text/javascript">
        var i = 4;
        var intervalid;
        var xy = document.getElementById("xy");
        intervalid = setInterval("fun()", 1000);
        function fun() {
            if (i == 0) {
                window.location.href = "https://www.piyao.org.cn/index.htm";
                clearInterval(intervalid);
            }
            xy.innerHTML = i;
            i--;
        }

        //导航
        $(function () {
            $('.nav__trigger').on('click', function (e) {
                e.preventDefault();
                $(this).parent().toggleClass('nav--active');
            });
        })
        //返回顶部
        $(".menu_list li").on("click", function () {
            $("html,body").animate({ scrollTop: 0 }, 500);
        });
    </script>
</body>

</html>